  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">14 Trees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">14Trees is a joint-venture between LafargeHolcim, a global leader in building materials based in Switzerland, and CDC. The venture aims to accelerate and scale up the production and commercialisation of Durabric bricks - an environmentally-friendly, affordable alternative to the clay burnt bricks widely used across sub-Saharan Africa, and other innovative green building solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
